 duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none" style="grid-template-rows:0fr"><div class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden" inert=""><div data-i18n-field="items[1].body_i18n" class="space-y-3 pb-5 transition-opacity duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none pr-8 opacity-0"><p dir="auto" class="whitespace-pre-line font-bk-body text-[15px] leading-loose text-bk-ink-soft text-pretty text-left">Most orders arrive within 24 hours of confirmation.</p></div></div></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1_-p2" class="flex min-h-14 w-full items-center gap-3 py-4 text-bk-ink transition-opacity duration-bk-fast active:opacity-70 motion-reduce:transition-none"><span data-i18n-field="items[2].title_i18n" class="flex-1 font-bk-display text-base font-bold leading-snug text-balance text-left">Premium warranty card &amp; return policy</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined shrink-0 text-xl text-bk-ink transition-transform duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true">expand_more</span></button><div id="_R_1_-p2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none" style="grid-template-rows:0fr"><div class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden" inert=""><div data-i18n-field="items[2].body_i18n" class="space-y-3 pb-5 transition-opacity duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none pr-8 opacity-0"><p dir="auto" class="whitespace-pre-line font-bk-body text-[15px] leading-loose text-bk-ink-soft text-pretty text-left">On delivery, quality, projection and longevity are verified with the courier present — any mismatch entitles you to refuse the product for a full refund.</p><p dir="auto" class="whitespace-pre-line font-bk-body text-[15px] leading-loose text-bk-ink-soft text-pretty text-left">You may keep and test the perfume for a full week from delivery; if the experience disappoints or the specs differ, return it for a full refund.</p></div></div></div></div><div><button t